  unitName: Duel-SGX
  unitId: 60255
  unitNumber: 529
  description: In the battle with Melchio's renewed form, this mechanical figure
    first clung to Michele like a scared puppy as she lay on the ground. However,
    when she tossed it off her and cursed its cowardice, it must have damaged its
    limiting circuits, for the machine soon transformed into a formidable weapon
    bent on destroying their enemy. Detecting that their foe was wielding an incredible
    destructive force of its own, Duel-SGX activated a hidden program. This time
    it wasn't following orders. It was acting on its own volition, its desire to
    protect its friends.
  summonDesc: MICHELE'S VOICE LOG SAVED.<br>READ-WRITE PERMISSIONS<br>RESTRICTED
    TO DUEL-SGX.
  fusionDesc: TUNING COMPLETE.<br>PERFORMANCE UPGRADE<br>CONFIRMED.
  evoDesc: FATAL ERROR.<br>CODE 666<br>EXECUTION COMMENCING.
